From d158a9b01dce978d8a7d14d2d44bf819ecb41b99 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gerardo Valenciano <gera.valenciano@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 19:52:06 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Launcher: a weather chip under the clock (weather_lat,
 weather_lon)

One GET to Open-Meteo when Home is shown and the last answer is 30 minutes old,
on a worker thread; off without both keys. Adds the INTERNET permission the
upstream launcher does not have. Shown with at most one row under the dock.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
